## Cloudflare R2 Bucket Structure

Lament stores all binary media assets (HLS audio segments, `.m3u8` manifests, cover artwork, and artist photos) on **Cloudflare R2**. R2 provides S3 API compatibility with zero egress data charges.

---

## Directory Key Conventions

```
lament-media/
├── hls/
│   └── <track_id>/
│       ├── playlist.m3u8       # HLS manifest playlist file
│       ├── segment0.ts         # MPEG-2 Transport Stream audio segment 0
│       ├── segment1.ts         # Audio segment 1
│       └── ...
├── covers/
│   ├── <track_id>_small.webp   # 150x150 thumbnail image
│   ├── <track_id>_medium.webp  # 400x400 medium image
│   ├── <track_id>_large.webp   # 800x800 high-res cover
│   └── <track_id>_original.webp# Original uncompressed cover
└── artists/
    ├── <artist_slug>.webp      # Artist profile picture
    └── <artist_slug>_banner.webp # Artist page header banner
```

---

## Image Variant Processing

When the scraper processes artwork, `sharp` generates WebP variants:

- **Small (`_small.webp`)**: Optimized for playlist rows and search suggestions (150px width).
- **Medium (`_medium.webp`)**: Optimized for mobile player views and album cards (400px width).
- **Large (`_large.webp`)**: High-resolution image for desktop expanded view (800px width).
- **Original (`_original.webp`)**: Direct uncompressed master artwork upload.
